k in your drinks, I highly recommend giving LMNT a try. I’ll definitely be getting more!\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1791833126},{\"comment_id\":332852447,\"user_name\":\"Diane H.\",\"rating\":1,\"content\":\"Taste was awful.\",\"source\":\"crawler\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1791831277}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Product Dimensions\",\"value\":\"4 x 1 x 1 inches; 4 ounces\"},{\"name\":\"ASIN\",\"value\":\"B0FNDJ2SCG\"},{\"name\":\"Units\",\"value\":\"2 Fluid Ounces\"},{\"name\":\"Customer Reviews\",\"value\":\"5\"},{\"name\":\"Brand Name\",\"value\":\"KD Chocolates\"},{\"name\":\"Unit Count\",\"value\":\"2 Fluid Ounces\"},{\"name\":\"Best Sellers Rank\",\"value\":\"#332,870 in Health \\u0026 Household (See Top 100 in Health \\u0026 Household)#1,372 in Sports Nutrition Electrolyte Replacement Drinks\"},{\"name\":\"ASIN\",\"value\":\"B0FNDJ2SCG\"},{\"name\":\"Customer Reviews\",\"value\":\"5.05.0 out of 5 stars(5)5.0 out of 5 stars\"}],\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"LMNT is a tasty electrolyte drink mix with more salt, and zero sugar or dodgy ingredients — perfect for active lifestyles, low-carb or keto diets, fasting, and those committed to their health. Electrolytes, particularly sodium and potassium, are the driving force behind energy production — from neurons to muscles to every heart beat. Salt and fluid replenishment is essential, and you might need more than you think. You feel the difference when you get it right.\\n\\nHow to Stay Salty: Mix one stick pack with 16-32 ounces of water, tea, smoothies, and more.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"target-94285133\",\"product_id\":120000071058128,\"cspu_id\":\"100000012725864\",\"url\":\"https://www.target.com/p/lmnt-zero-sugar-electrolytes-sports-drink-variety-pack-2-1oz-10ct/-/A-94285133\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":1619000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"Target