":329345218,\"user_name\":\"Chris\",\"rating\":1,\"content\":\"i order 80 dollars for 5 times for a send a price and it never sent so i erased everything and left off\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"create_time\":1791158400},{\"comment_id\":329345224,\"user_name\":\"SharathS\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"How can these candies be so addictive. The mini size is great and one can't figure out how much one has had. I love having these with ice cream. they taste amazing and elevate the taste of every item. The size of the jar is perfect . It is a big jar which is perfect for the entire family.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":1,\"create_time\":1790899200},{\"comment_id\":329345220,\"user_name\":\"KeylaV\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"This product is amazing, the quality of the product, the packing,the flavor and the presentation is a 10/10 for ones who love chocolate. Its a classic everyone must have in their kitchens. Helps as a snack and for making desserts and bakery. The portions is more than I expected so that is a plus.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1790899200},{\"comment_id\":329345219,\"user_name\":\"DianeV\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"M\\u0026M's minis milk chocolate candies are irresistible. I love to use them in baking recipes or straight out of the candy dish! I love to bake with the minis as they add a pop of color as well as the delicious taste of milk chocolate. The plastic container packaging is convenient, especially with storage. The air tight container keeps it fresh.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1790899200},{\"comment_id\":329345217,\"user_name\":\"AnnieS\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I LOVE m\\u0026m minis. They're so good! It's the perfect packaging and I love that I could use these minis as toppings for ice cream or just a great snack in general!\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1790899200}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Product Dimensi