ggiecom\",\"rating\":3,\"content\":\"I know we're living in the age of skrinkflation, but this is ridiculous. M%26M's has made a sad choice. They used to be joyful little buttons of color. I just opened this bag and there's so little crispy color on them you can see the chocolate through it. They taste fine, but they look gross. Even the “M”s look sloppy.\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"user_name\":\"Onogoro\",\"rating\":3,\"content\":\"Just does not seem like M%26Ms are as tasty as I remember. The outer shell adds nothing to the flavor or texture and the chocolate just ain't all that good. I find, with few exceptions almost all chocolate these days to be lacking so take my review with that grain of salt. If you like M%26Ms go for it. If, against all odds you've never had a tiny morsel of hard coated milk chocolate by this name I would say skip it for a better grade of chocolate.\",\"sort_order\":2},{\"user_name\":\"SavyShopper\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"These melt in your mouth, not in your hand treats are favorites of all generations. Any holiday now includes M%26Ms, regular or minis, as part of baking traditions. Just seeing the bag and my mind fills with all manner of baked goods dotted with these multi-colored treats! Might say “Any celebration starts with ‘M”!!\",\"sort_order\":3},{\"user_name\":\"Rose\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"❤️❤️❤️. Love M%26Ms, one of the best candies around this was a great deal the party size bag. It's like a big bag that once you start eating them you're not gonna stop but I have to You got that great hard outer candy. shell, and then that creamy milk chocolate on the inside. like I said great value great price great everything so grab yourself a bag and enjoy.\",\"sort_order\":4}]}},\"rcmd_reason_tag\":[\"Party Ready\",\"Delicious\",\"Easy to Share\"],\"rcmd_reason\":[\"Party Ready: a 38 oz bag suits parties, buffets, break rooms, and favor bags.\",\"Delicious Classic Treat: real milk chocolate and colorful shells make the treat.\",\"Easy 