un: soft chewy strips suit mealtime snacks or smaller reward pieces.\"],\"rcmd_reason_markdown\":\"- **Bacony Taste:** real bacon flavor and meat-first recipe create irresistible strips.\\n- **Cleaner Treat:** no artificial flavors or FD\\u0026C colors are used.\\n- **Chewy Fun:** soft chewy strips suit mealtime snacks or smaller reward pieces.\",\"product_tags\":[{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Bacony\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Cleaner\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Chewy\"}],\"like_info\":{\"state\":1,\"item_id\":null,\"cspu_id\":null,\"country\":\"US\",\"state_version\":\"0\"}}}","at":1792812326670,"synthetic":1},{"k":"fetch","m":"POST","u":"https://sg.migoo.test.shopee.io/beeai/api/v1/pdp/info","b":"{\"region\":\"US\",\"cspu_id\":\"100000012780028\",\"offer_id\":\"amazon-B0G3YCZ1LC-B0CP2Q75HM\"}","s":200,"ct":"application/json; charset=utf-8","t":"{\"code\":0,\"message\":\"success\",\"results\":{\"request_id\":\"502e5a7d-594d-49b4-b998-2e15cd8ce188\",\"region\":\"US\",\"agg_level\":4,\"item_id\":0,\"shop_id\":0,\"cspu_id\":\"100000012780028\",\"model_id\":0,\"hero_media\":{\"product_image_id\":[\"https://cf.shopee.sg/file/sg-11134327-8258y-mqjiqscqjax7b5\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sukgWu8aL._SL1500_.jpg\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-HyM9+YAL._SL1500_.jpg\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gxSTxtJtL._SL1500_.jpg\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bC+K6nymL._SL1500_.jpg\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ELQVfWhpL._SL1500_.jpg\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717YHOj23nL._SL1500_.jpg\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rk1RYo0JL._SL1500_.jpg\"]},\"summary\":{\"title\":\"Cyberpunk 2077: Ultimate Edition - PlayStation 5\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":4499000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"usd\"}},\"variation_infos\":null,\"model_infos\":{\"models\":[{\"offer_id\":\"amazon-B0G3YCZ1LC-B0CP2Q75HM\",\"extinfo\":{}}],\"cur_model_idx\":0},\"review_data\":{\"summary\":{\"total_count\":901,\"summary_text\":\"\",\"rating_max\":4.7}},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Publication Date\",\"value\":\"December 5, 2023\"},{\"name\":\"Global Trade Identification Number\",\"value\":\"00810136671230\"},{\"name\":\"UPC\",\"value\":\"810136671230\"},{\"name\":\"Compatible Video Game Console Models\",\"value\":\"Sony PlayStation 5\"},{\"name\":\"ASIN\",\"value\":\"B0CP2Q75HM\"},{\"name\":\"Release date\",\"value\":\"December 5, 2023\"},{\"name\":\"Customer Reviews\",\"value\":\"4.74.7 out of 5 stars(901)4.7 out of 5 stars\"},{\"name\":\"Best Sellers Rank\",\"value\":\"#361 in Video Games (See Top 100 in Video Games)#71 in PlayStation 5 Games\"},{\"name\":\"Package Dimensions\",\"value\":\"6.73 x 5.35 x 0.59 inches; 2.82 ounces\"},{\"name\":\"Type of item\",\"value\":\"Video Game\"},{\"name\":\"Language\",\"value\":\"English\"},{\"name\":\"Rated\",\"value\":\"Mature\"},{\"name\":\"Item model number\",\"value\":\"0810136671230\"},{\"name\":\"Item Weight\",\"value\":\"2.82 ounces\"},{\"name\":\"Department\",\"value\":\"Adults\"},{\"name\":\"Manufacturer\",\"value\":\"CD Projekt Red\"},{\"name\":\"Date First Available\",\"value\":\"November 22, 2023\"}],\"rich_text\":[{\"type\":0,\"text\":\"Highlights\\nCyberpunk 2077 Ultimate Edition for PlayStation 5 includes Phantom Liberty expansion.\\nPlay as V, a cyberpunk mercenary in the open-world action-adventure RPG Night City.\\nBuild your character, reputation, and unlock upgrades through jobs and choices.\\nPhantom Liberty features new spy-thriller gameplay, Dogtown, and a main quest with Solomon Reed and Johnny Silverhand.\\n\\nDetails\\nOverview\\nCyberpunk 2077 is an open-world, action-adventure RPG set in the megalopolis of Night City, where you play as a cyberpunk mercenary wrapped up in a do-or-die fight for survival. The relationships you forge and the choices you make will shape the story and the world around you. Legends are made here.\\nFunction \\u0026 Performance\\nThe Ultimate Edition includes the critically acclaimed and highly anticipated expansion to the original game: Phantom Liberty. Phantom Liberty is a new spy-thriller adventure for Cyberpunk 2077. When the orbital shuttle of the President of the New United States of America is shot down over the deadliest district of Night City, there's only one person who can save her — you. Become V, a cyberpunk for hire, and dive deep into a tangled web of espionage and political intrigue, unraveling a story that connects the highest echelons of power with the brutal world of black-market mercenaries. Infiltrate Dogtown, a city-within-a-city run by a trigger-happy militia and ruled by a leader with an iron fist. With the help of NUSA sleeper agent Solomon Reed (Idris Elba) and the support of Johnny Silverhand (Keanu Reeves), unravel a web of shattered loyalties and use your every skill to survive in a fractured world of desperate hustlers, shadowy netrunners, and ruthless mercenaries. Built with the power of next-gen hardware in mind, Phantom Liberty offers brand-new gameplay mechanics, nail-biting courier jobs, gigs, and missions — and a thrilling main quest where freedom and loyalty always come at a price.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"amazon-B0G3YCZ1LC-B0CP2Q75HM\",\"product_id\":120000311541224,\"cspu_id\":\"100000012780028\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.com/Cyberpunk-2077-Ultimate-PlayStation-5/dp/B0CP2Q75HM?th=1\\u0026psc=1\\u0026language=en_US\\u0026currency=USD\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":4499000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"Bestofbulk USA\",\"supplier_rating\":4.7,\"website\":\"amazon\",\"website_logo_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-825a2-mqmt8xcg7abw3c\"},\"cheapest_info\":{\"content\":\"Cheapest in 30 days\",\"chart\":{\"type\":1,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"window_days\":30,\"date_list\":[1790265600,1790352000,1790438400,1790524800,1790611200,1790697600,1790784000,1790870400,1790956800,1791043200,17911