_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-824ij-mput674daadqbc\",\"video_urls\":[\"https://www.amazon.com/vdp/0457a9490e8b4a42adf0ce1b71235da5\",\"https://www.amazon.com/vdp/0ac48f70691342f19053189db820a350\"],\"review_data\":{\"featured_reviews\":[{\"user_name\":\"Hope G.\",\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"I am trying the mini food storage set for our lunches. Be AWARE that you canNOT microwave the lids! I missed that info on the website. I don't know why but that makes it inconvenient. I don't want to grab a different covering to microwave.We will try them out but after seeing the sticker on the lid; I am a little disappointed. (The shipment arrived yesterday.)\"},{\"user_name\":\"Crystal B.\",\"rating\":1,\"content\":\"Not at all impressed with these. The price is definitely not worth it. One of the lids cracked out of no where (I hand wash them). Can only use silicone or soft plastic utensils with them since they scratch so easily. They also stain which is annoying. Should have just saved my money and bought glass containers with silicone lids.\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"user_name\":\"Alexandria E.\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I've bought several storage containers over the years, and this is by far the best set I've owned. Caraway has truly set the bar. Even the packaging is stunning, and I never expected storage containers to bring me this much joy! The organizer included with the set is thoughtfully designed and makes storing everything so easy. It really feels like they didn't leave anything out. The quality is excellent, which matters to me — I'd much rather pay a bit more upfront for something that lasts than keep replacing cheaper options. The added warranty gives even more peace of mind. Highly recommend!\",\"sort_order\":2},{\"user_name\":\"April G.\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"Good replacement for the plastic storage bowls. Had a blood toxicity test and plastics came out too high. This was one of the things I changed to get that down! I use these