risp, cold, caffeinated, and somehow tastes even better straight from a can. Is it solving any of my actual problems? Absolutely not. Does cracking open an ice-cold Diet Coke make me feel like I can deal with those problems? Yes. Yes it does.\\n\\nThe cans are the superior form of Diet Coke, and I will not be taking questions at this time. Keep them cold, keep them stocked, and nobody gets hurt.\\n\\n10/10. Will continue purchasing in quantities that suggest I'm preparing for an apocalypse. (And yes I have it tattooed on me)\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":2,\"create_time\":1789084800},{\"comment_id\":332126286,\"user_name\":\"STACY\",\"rating\":1,\"content\":\"The 12 pack was broken and saturated. The driver and I looked and thought nothing busted but when I brought it inside, 3 cans are bulging and one leaking. These are too expensive for that kind of delivery\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":3,\"create_time\":1788048000},{\"comment_id\":332126287,\"user_name\":\"anonymous\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I lose more weight when I drink Diet Coke than when I drink any other type of soda or carbonated drinks. And now I'm used to the taste so it's just like drinking a regular Coke to me.Except regular Coke taste funny to me now and it puts weight on me. I recommend trying Diet Coke especially if you wanna drop a few pounds in a month.\",\"source\":\"brightdata\",\"sort_order\":4,\"create_time\":1787270400}]},\"item_details\":{\"product_spec\":[{\"name\":\"Product Dimensions\",\"value\":\"15.8 x 5.3 x 4.9 inches; 9.47 pounds\"},{\"name\":\"Item model number\",\"value\":\"049000028911\"},{\"name\":\"UPC\",\"value\":\"049000028911\"},{\"name\":\"Manufacturer\",\"value\":\"Coca-Cola\"},{\"name\":\"ASIN\",\"value\":\"B000T9WLUY\"},{\"name\":\"Units\",\"value\":\"144 Fluid Ounces\"},{\"name\":\"Customer Reviews\",\"value\":\"25717\"},{\"name\":\"Brand Name\",\"value\":\"Diet Coke\"},{\"name\":\"Item Form\",\"value\":\"Liquid\"},{\"name\":\"Flavor\",\"valu