ny time. Diet Coke is an original flavor that you can turn to whenever you want a diet soda, offering a taste that always hits the spot.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"walmart-10291610\",\"product_id\":120000091259482,\"cspu_id\":\"100000012409340\",\"url\":\"https://www.walmart.com/ip/Diet-Coke-Diet-Soda-Fridge-Pack-12-fl-oz-Cans-12-Pack/10291610\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":757000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"Walmart.com\",\"supplier_rating\":4.7,\"website\":\"walmart\",\"website_logo_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-824ij-mput674daadqbc\",\"video_urls\":[\"https://www.amazon.com/vdp/005d7ada9df14ff4b42718ebd990a427\"],\"review_data\":{\"featured_reviews\":[{\"user_name\":\"anonymous\",\"rating\":4,\"content\":\"Well Diet Coke for sure tastes different than regular coke..I know your like duh. But with the advances in sweetners and stuff sometimes I'm surprised. This is not flat it does give the fizz of regular cola. But it does not have that strong cola taste. I figured since it was on sale and I was starting a diet that it would be a good idea to get this. But to be honest it does not take the place of a soda. It does not taste like regular soda. But if I'm not mistaken it's zero calories so if that's the case then it's great.\"},{\"user_name\":\"Rvbridgeman63\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I've been drinking Coke since I was a little kid and I'm 63 years old. It's the best all the other ones are just second or eighth i've been drinking Coke since I was a little kid and I'm 63 years old. It's the best all the other ones are just second and third place.\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"user_name\":\"anonymous\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I'm going to review this item second hand. my wife drinks this. she loves the stuff. she won't drink anything but diet Coke. I feel that I should invest in the company, LOL. she says it tastes great and doesn't have aftertaste like the others do. that it gives her a little pep. and even when it warms up from sitting around it still tastes good. she told me I better recommend it! so there you go.\",\"sort_order\":2},{\"user_name\":\"heidi\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"I don't buy soda when the price rises unreasonably. $8.50 for a 12 pack that was $6.50 2 years ago (and right now it's right at $8.50 for a 12 pack). But $9.50 for a 24 pack? Now we are talking. Bought one then bought another one and what the heck I'm going in for a third.\",\"sort_order\":3},{\"user_name\":\"JandJ\",\"rating\":5,\"content\":\"If you need to read a review before buying Diet Coke, stop what you're doing, go out and get one, and find out what you've been missing. If you are reading this review because you are concerned that 24 cans may be too many I promise you it is not.\\nThe box is a little tricky to fit in the fridge.\",\"sort_order\":4}]}},\"rcmd_reason_tag\":[\"Sugar-Free\",\"Crisp\",\"Stock Up\"],\"rcmd_reason\":[\"Sugar-Free Refreshment: no sugar, no calories, and no added sugar.\",\"Crisp Refreshment: carbonated Diet Coke delivers a crisp, cold taste.\",\"Stock-Up Convenience: twelve 12 fl oz cans provide 144 fluid ounces.\"],\"rcmd_reason_markdown\":\"- **Sugar-Free Refreshment:** no sugar, no calories, and no added sugar.\\n- **Crisp Refreshment:** carbonated Diet Coke delivers a crisp, cold taste.\\n- **Stock-Up Convenience:** twelve 12 fl oz cans provide 144 fluid ounces.\",\"product_tags\":[{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Sugar-Free\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Crisp\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Stock Up\"}],\"like_info\":{\"state\":1,\"item_id\":null,\"cspu_id\":null,\"country\":\"US\",\"state_version\":\"0\"}}}","at":1792812327987,"synthetic":1},{"k":"fetch","m":"POST","u":"https://sg.migoo.test.shopee.io/beeai/api/v1/pdp/info","b":"{\"region\":\"US\",\"cspu_id\":\"100000011511941\",\"offer_id\":\"amazon-B07JFPZ3CF-B075SNBNMR\"}","s":200,"ct":"application/json; charset=utf-8","t":"{\"code\":0,\"message\