d-free materials, carrying UL certification #B80321985.\\nCare Instructions\\nSimple care involves wiping the interior thoroughly or hand washing it. The exterior can be spot cleaned. The bag must dry completely before freezing and is not machine or dishwasher safe.\"}]},\"action_infos\":null,\"offer\":{\"id\":\"amazon-B0G1ZLZS3S-B01MT9R0A2\",\"product_id\":120000568927690,\"cspu_id\":\"100000012773665\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.com/PackIt-Freezable-EcoFreeze-Technology-Foldable/dp/B01MT9R0A2?th=1\\u0026psc=1\\u0026language=en_US\\u0026currency=USD\",\"availability\":\"in_stock\",\"price\":{\"single_value\":3999000,\"range_min\":0,\"range_max\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"supplier_name\":\"Amazon.com\",\"supplier_rating\":4.5,\"website\":\"amazon\",\"website_logo_url\":\"https://down-sg.img.susercontent.com/sg-11134327-825a2-mqmt8xcg7abw3c\"},\"rcmd_reason_tag\":[\"Keeps Fresh\",\"Easy to Carry\",\"Space-Saving\"],\"rcmd_reason\":[\"Fresh Groceries: EcoFreeze technology helps keep groceries fresh during transport.\",\"Easier Carrying: dual handles make the tote easier to carry from store to home.\",\"Easier Storage: foldable, collapsible design saves space between uses.\"],\"rcmd_reason_markdown\":\"- **Fresh Groceries:** EcoFreeze technology helps keep groceries fresh during transport.\\n- **Easier Carrying:** dual handles make the tote easier to carry from store to home.\\n- **Easier Storage:** foldable, collapsible design saves space between uses.\",\"product_tags\":[{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Keeps Fresh\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Easy to Carry\"},{\"type\":7,\"content\":\"Space-Saving\"}],\"like_info\":{\"state\":1,\"item_id\":null,\"cspu_id\":null,\"country\":\"US\",\"state_version\":\"0\"}}}","at":1792812328548,"synthetic":1},{"k":"fetch","m":"POST","u":"https://sg.migoo.test.shopee.io/beeai/api/v1/pdp/info","b":"{\"region\":\"US\",\"cspu_id\":\"100000018035918\",\"offer_id\":\"ebay-406669042420\"}","s":200,"ct":"application/json; charset=utf-8","t":"{\"co